            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Draplet 0.5.1 Alpha</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed the Pocket arrow covering or clipping the AirPods sound icon in the menu bar.</li>
<li>Pocket now accounts for native system status icons when placing its arrow.</li>
</ul>
<p>Small bug-fix release, build 46. Your settings and pinned apps are preserved.</p>
<p>Apple silicon, macOS 14.2+. Alpha signing and compatibility limits remain unchanged.</p>
]]></description>
